      "top_k": 50,
      "seed": 8112080,
      "caption": "Slow, solemn dark-ambient orchestral piece with a heavy industrial undertow. Deep bowed cello and low brass drone, sparse detuned analog synthesizer pads, distant metallic percussion struck once or twice per bar with long reverb tails. A cold, wide, cathedral-sized space. Restrained and patient, never triumphant, never cinematic-trailer. Mid-tempo around 70 BPM, minor key. A single clear low male synthetic voice, measured and unhurried, more intoned than sung. Analog tape warmth, no bright digital sheen, no dance percussion, no distorted guitars.",
